      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated trainers and boarding associates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners consistently highlight the trainers and front desk associates for their dedication, patience, and deep understanding of canine behavior. Reviewers frequently single out instructors like Juliana, Jen, and Melanie for working closely with energetic puppies and rescue dogs. Clients appreciate that instructors explain handling methods clearly so households can maintain structure."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comforting care for anxious dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the facility for handling dogs with severe anxiety, leash reactivity, or behavioral sensitivities. Pet parents report that staff maintain calm, structured environments where nervous dogs gradually gain confidence and social neutrality. Reviewers note that their companions feel safe during daycare playgroups and boarding stays."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective behavioral training programs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report clear behavioral improvements following multi-week bootcamps, puppy imprinting, and adventure training courses. Many owners note that formerly reactive dogs learned reliable leash manners, crate habits, and calm reactions around city distractions. While one reviewer found basic cues overpriced relative to results, most clients celebrate substantial obedience gains."
      }
    }
  ],
